# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local `wrangler pages dev` testing.
# Never commit the real .dev.vars file or a real key.
#
# Without this set, /api/chat answers entirely from the local,
# resume-grounded rule engine (src/lib/assistant.ts) — no API needed.
#
# To enable real AI-backed answers in production, set the same variable as
# a secret instead of committing it anywhere:
#   npx wrangler pages secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
